\begin_layout Standard
In the preferences of the themes new custom themes can be created (
\series bold
New
\series default
, based on the light or the dark default theme), duplicated (
\series bold
Duplicate
\series default
, e.g., to change an example theme), deleted, imported and exported (
\series bold
Import...
\series default
, 
\series bold
Export...
\series default
: a theme is stored as one *.bio7theme file which can be shared). The default themes can not be changed. A preview shows the toolbar and the view tabs with the settings of the selected theme. The settings of a custom theme are:
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize

\series bold
Name, Author, Based on:
\series default
 The name, the author and the default theme which is the base of the theme (light or dark).
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize

\series bold
Toolbar:
\series default
 The style of the main toolbar (e.g., flat, gradient or raised).
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize

\series bold
Colors:
\series default
 The colors of the window and view backgrounds, the view panels, the text, the tab row, the selected tab, the tab text, the tab border, the view toolbar text, the toolbar (top and bottom of the gradient) and its text, the status bar, the icon and icon detail color, the editor background and text, the console, the buttons and the text fields. 
\series bold
Reset Colors
\series default
 restores the original colors of the theme.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize

\series bold
View Tabs:
\series default
 The style of the tab rows of the views (flat, gradient or raised) with an optional artwork image (an own fade and opacity), the artwork in the tab rows below the first row and the opacity of the selected tab.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize

\series bold
Fonts:
\series default
 The font of the views and widgets and the text font of the editors and the console.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize

\series bold
Toolbar Artwork:
\series default
 An image (SVG, PNG, JPG, GIF, TIFF, BMP) for the background of the main toolbar: the mode (tiled or stretched), the tile size, the opacity and the fade (e.g., visible at the left and faded out to the right). With 
\series bold
Continue in the view tab rows
\series default
 the artwork continues from the toolbar into the tab rows below it (one picture).
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize

\series bold
Layout (all themes):
\series default
 The gap below the main toolbar and between the views. The gaps can be saved with the selected theme (they are exported with the theme).
\end_layout

