\series default
 the colors of the Bio7 icons (*.svg) can be changed: the icon color and the detail color (white by default, e.g., the letters of the file icons) for the light and the dark theme. The preview shows the icons with the colors. A custom theme has its own icon colors. The Eclipse icons and the Bio7 logo keep their colors. A change is applied after a restart of Bio7.
