\begin_layout Section
Bio7 Browser
\begin_inset CommandInset label
LatexCommand label
name "sec:Bio7-Browser"

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Bio7 embeds a web browser in the 
\series bold
Browser
\series default
 view (
\series bold
Help > Bio7 Internet
\series default
). The view uses the SWT browser, the web engine of the operating system (no JavaFX browser is used anymore). By default it opens the online manual of Bio7. The toolbar of the view contains link menus to useful resources (e.g., the ImageJ documentation, plugins and forum, the R task views, tutorials and references, OpenStreetMap), the address field with 
\series bold
Go
\series default
, 
\series bold
Back
\series default
, 
\series bold
Forward
\series default
, 
\series bold
Stop
\series default
, 
\series bold
Refresh
\series default
, 
\series bold
Home
\series default
 and 
\series bold
Bio7 Manual
\series default
 and a zoom. Files (e.g., *.html or *.pdf) can be dropped on the address field to open them.
\end_layout

