\begin_layout Section
Uninstall Eclipse Plugins
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
The about dialog embeds an action to uninstall installed Eclipse plugins
 or revert the installation of Bio7 to a specific date of installation.
 In this way a corrupted installation can be reverted to a previous state
 of installation.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Section
Programming Examples for Bio7
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
The application Bio7 is distributed with a rich set of programming examples,
 which should facilitate the development of ecological models.
 The examples are so called Snippets (short programming examples) which
 are numbered and divided into two projects.
 One project (
\series bold
Bio7_Java_Examples
\series default
) contains Java snippets for the different components of Bio7 which demonstrates
 how to use them and the flexibility of the platform in general.
 The other project 
\series bold
Bio7_Script_Examples
\series default
 contains snippets as examples for the scripting languages.
 This Snippets also show that you can use the different embedded application
 and modules to understand and analyze complex systems or bundle them in
 ecological modeling for more complex purposes.
 The examples are available as projects.
 Please import them with 
\series bold
\noun on
File\SpecialChar \menuseparator
Import\SpecialChar \menuseparator
Existing Projects into Workspace
\series default
\noun default
 into your Bio7 workspace.
 The Snippets can also be browsed and downloaded on github: 
\begin_inset Flex URL
status open

\begin_layout Plain Layout

https://github.com/Bio7
\end_layout

\end_inset

.
\end_layout

